DESCRIPTION:Our mission is to build a stronger human firewall by empowering
  students of every background and skill level with the knowledge\, skills\
 , and confidence to thrive in cybersecurity. As a club within the Informat
 ion Technology and Decision Sciences department\, we bridge the technical 
 and the strategic\, preparing students not only to defend systems but also
  to understand the risks\, decisions\, and business impact behind them. He
 re\, every member learns by doing and leaves ready to shape the future of 
 cybersecurity.
